  "Description": {
    "Cost": 655181,
    "UIName": "Dasher II",
    "Id": "chassisdef_dasher_ii_DSH2-4",
    "Name": "Dasher II",
    "Details": "This variant is equipped for close combat. It carries a chain whip and Triple Strength Myomer, while an XL gyro and XXL engine free up space for more weaponry. The Dasher II 4 carries two LRM-5 launchers, an ER large laser, ER medium laser, and ER small laser, while a single micro pulse laser provides some anti-infantry support. The 'Mech's top speed is usually 100 km/h, but with the TSM active it can hit 110 km/h. Eight improved jump jets allow it to cover 240 meters per jump, and the Dasher II 4's armor protection is enhanced with the use of hardened armor.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Narrow/Low Profile</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.08</color></b>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_dasherii"
  },
